5,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Since our current habit isn't working, we need a sustainable system for the year. I suggest we look into the actual time and effort required before we decide on a new arrangement.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I agree, Minako. A system built on guesswork is destined to fail. It would be prudent to gather some empirical data on our current habits before we commit to a year-long contract with ourselves.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I'm excited to help! I want to know why the rooms change so much. Let's find out what's really going on! I'll help look for clues!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is so lovely to see everyone so eager to help. I agree that we should be fair to one another. Let's make sure we understand the costs and the effort involved so everyone feels comfortable.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to see such harmony. Let us remember that the strength of a home lies not in the cleanliness of its floors, but in the kindness we show one another. Let us seek clarity together.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,I believe we should start by examining the facts. I will look into the stopwatch timing of a full pass and the standard terms of the outside firm to compare our options.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"To ensure we aren't merely rearranging the deck chairs on the Titanic, I shall examine a fortnight's watch on kitchen use and the absences on the wall calendar. Let's see who is actually home to make the mess.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I want to solve the mystery of the messy rooms! I'll check what each housemate counts as done and the rows recorded in the house chat to see if there are any secret clues!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I think it would be helpful to see the management office rate sheet and billing, as well as the bathroom spray stock and the tin's receipts. It is important that we are all fair with our expenses.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,I shall look into the note left by the previous tenants and the bathroom grout after the July scrub. Wisdom often hides in the experiences of those who walked this path before us.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,"It seems we have a comprehensive plan. By dividing these tasks, we can cover both the financial and physical aspects of the chores. I look forward to seeing what the data reveals.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. It is far more elegant to let the evidence guide us than to rely on the fickle nature of memory. I suspect we may find some rather illuminating discrepancies once the numbers are in.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! This is like being a detective! I can't wait to see if everyone has a different idea of what ""clean"" actually means. It's going to be so interesting!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I am glad we are all working together so harmoniously. I hope the information we find helps us create a peaceful arrangement where everyone feels appreciated and no one feels burdened.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, my friends. As we gather these fragments of information, let us keep our hearts open. The goal is not to find fault, but to build a bridge of understanding for the year ahead.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minako,,"Since we have all selected our areas of investigation, let us proceed. I will wait for the findings so we can analyze the time and cost implications objectively.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Quite. I shall retreat into my studies and await the results. I trust that once the data is laid bare, the most logical path forward will reveal itself to us all.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Me too! I'm going to go hunt for those clues right now! I hope I find something super surprising! See you all soon with my detective report!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I shall do the same. I will look into the bills and receipts with a gentle heart, hoping to find a way for us all to share the costs comfortably. See you all soon.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Go in peace, everyone. Let us approach our findings with grace and a spirit of generosity. I shall await the results, keeping our shared friendship as my primary guide. Until we meet again.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
