60,3,1,talk,Minako,,"Option A is too rigid given the usage imbalances Benjamin noted. Option C risks the rift Servas mentioned. Option B is the most efficient, provided we accept the tidying labor. I vote for Option B.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Option B is a seductive shortcut, but it ignores the root cause. If we simply outsource the labor, we still have the issue of who creates the mess and who tidies for the cleaner. I vote for Option B.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"I don't like Option C because it sounds like the scary rift Servas talked about! Option B is okay, but Option A is like a game! I vote for Option A!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Option B seems very convenient, but I worry about how we will handle the payments. If we choose B, can we also agree on a simple way to share the supply costs? I vote for Option B.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Option C is a path to silence and distance, as the previous tenants learned. Option A may breed resentment. Option B allows us to focus on our friendship rather than our chores. I vote for Option B.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Sakura, while a game is fun, the time burden is too high for a simple rota. Since four of us agree that Option B is the most sustainable path, it seems the decision is clear.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a rare occasion when we achieve such swift consensus. While I maintain my skepticism regarding the tidying logistics, the logic of efficiency prevails. I shall concede to the majority.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"Aww, everyone is picking B! I guess a professional cleaner is like a magic trick for the house! If we do B, can we still have a little checklist for the tidying part? I still want it to be a game!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"That is a lovely idea, Sakura. A little checklist for tidying would keep us all on the same page. As long as we also settle our supply costs fairly, I think we will be very happy.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"A checklist is a wonderful way to maintain clarity without the weight of a law, Sakura. Let us embrace this magic trick with gratitude, ensuring our hearts remain as clean as our home.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Minako,,"Since we are in agreement, we will adopt Option B. We can integrate Sakura's checklist for tidying and Shizue's shared fund for supplies to ensure the system is comprehensive and fair.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A pragmatic compromise. By combining the professional service with a checklist and a fund, we address the labor, the standards, and the finances in one stroke. It is a reasonably elegant solution to a messy problem.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! A magic cleaner, a checklist game, and a money jar! Now the bathroom won't be scary anymore and the kitchen will stay sparkly! I'm so happy we solved the mystery together!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I am so glad we could all agree. It warms my heart to see us caring for one another this way. I will be more than happy to help organize our little money jar.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,"It is a beautiful thing to see such a resolution. By choosing a path of cooperation over conflict, we have ensured that our home remains a sanctuary of peace. May our friendship flourish.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Minako,,"The decision is final. We will proceed with Option B, supplemented by a tidying checklist and a shared supply fund. I will help coordinate the initial setup to ensure the transition is smooth for everyone.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I shall lend my assistance in drafting the checklist. If we are to avoid the ""absurdity"" of unfair labor, we must be precise about what constitutes ""tidying"" before the professionals arrive. Logic, after all, is the best deterrent for resentment.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Sakura,,I'll help too! I can draw cute little pictures next to the things on the checklist to make it look like a treasure map! This is the best detective mission ever!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I will make sure we have a lovely little jar for our supplies and a clear way to track our contributions. Thank you all for being so thoughtful. I look forward to our peaceful home.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Servas,,"Your enthusiasm and diligence are a gift to this house. Let us move forward with light hearts, remembering that the true beauty of our home is the love we share. Peace be with you all.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
